{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an action game focused on combat, where a girl returns from the abyss to explore her own secrets and redemption, trapped in a cycle of battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/itch-light-atk-sheet-Sheet_18.png?t=1745349798\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge enemies with different combat styles, proficiently use your abilities, enhance attributes, match runes, and defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/2.png?t=1745349798\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The selection of artifacts is crucial, as each artifact has unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/3.png?t=1745349798\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock runes and freely match them to create a suitable combat style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various exciting bosses await your challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique gameplay style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combination of melee, ranged, and artifact, with diverse attack methods</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2654350?t=1745349798","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/25402f06c4158e22c60467edc8011f611b4762c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745349798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/15a8d6bbd51aae63409626135e92ab0e20425de4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745349798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai